	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g3","type":"group","x":-300,"y":820,"width":1600,"height":340,"label":"3. Metrik Evaluasi & Uji Signifikansi Statistik (Bab III Subbab 3.5.1 & 3.5.3)"},
		{"id":"g1","type":"group","x":-300,"y":-180,"width":1470,"height":340,"label":"1. Skenario Komparasi 3 Model & Uji Ablasi (Bab III Subbab 3.5.2 & 3.5.5)"},
		{"id":"g2","type":"group","x":-300,"y":330,"width":1600,"height":290,"label":"2. Matriks Eksekusi Masif (540 Batch Run, Seed=42)"},
		{"id":"n1","type":"text","text":"### 1A. Kontrol: Naive Random\n\n- Pemilihan lagu acak tanpa struktur waypoint maupun trajektori\n- Batas bawah (*lower bound*) kinerja","x":-180,"y":-80,"width":330,"height":205,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n2","type":"text","text":"### 1B. Baseline: Gaur (2023/2024)\n`[Static-Point Matching]`\n\n- Replikasi 2-tahap KNN pada titik rata-rata $(\\bar{v}, \\bar{a})$ + fitur audio 12D PCA\n- Tanpa info trajektori 2 Hz","x":340,"y":-95,"width":340,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","text":"### 1C. Model Usulan (2 Konfigurasi)\n`[Meyes 2019; Bendada 2023]`\n\n- **Ablasi OFF** ($\\lambda_{\\mathrm{traj}} = 0$): hanya titik statis\n- **Ablasi ON** ($\\lambda_{\\mathrm{traj}} > 0$): *Trajectory Alignment* + $\\mathcal{BJC}$","x":810,"y":-130,"width":330,"height":255,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"### 2. Korpus & Split Terkontrol\n\n- DEAM 1.802 klip (*song-level holdout split*)\n- Penguncian `seed=42`\n- Jumlah kandidat $K$, bobot jarak, & pool sama persis untuk semua model","x":-185,"y":380,"width":340,"height":215,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"### 3. 6 Rute Kuadran (540 Batch Run)\n\n- **Diagonal:** Q3 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q1, Q2 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q4\n- **Horizontal:** Q1 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q2, Q3 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q4\n- **Vertical:** Q1 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q4, Q2 $\\leftrightarrow$ Q3\n- Variasi $K$, panjang $M$, & trial","x":370,"y":380,"width":350,"height":215,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n6","type":"text","text":"### 4. Output Playlist per Model\n\n- 540 playlist per konfigurasi\n- Menyimpan koordinat `intro` & `outro` setiap pasang lagu $(L_j, L_{j+1})$","x":960,"y":380,"width":310,"height":215,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n7","type":"text","text":"### 5. Hitung 3 Metrik Objektif\n`[Bab III 3.5.1, Eq. 3.8 - 3.10]`\n\n- **Boundary Smoothness** ($\\mathcal{S}$): rata-rata lonjakan *outro-intro* (target turun $\\ge 15\\%$)\n- **Evenness Index** ($\\mathcal{E}$): variansi langkah\n- **Cumulative BJC** ($\\mathcal{CBJC}$): total penalti","x":-220,"y":870,"width":350,"height":230,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n9","type":"text","text":"### 7. Keputusan & Analisis Diagnostik\n\n- Jika $p < 0,05$ & $\\mathcal{S}$ turun $\\ge 15\\%$: hipotesis diterima\n- *Fallback*: analisis diagnostik per kuadran","x":840,"y":870,"width":310,"height":215,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n8","type":"text","text":"### 6. Uji Wilcoxon Signed-Rank\n`[Bab III 3.5.3 & 3.5.5]`\n\n- Uji non-parametrik berpasangan ($\\alpha = 0,05$)\n- Bandingkan Usulan vs Gaur & Ablasi ON vs OFF\n- Bukti kausalitas kontribusi modul trajektori","x":320,"y":870,"width":340,"height":270,"color":"1"}
	],
